 SassoonInfantRg-Regular;\">Turn, turn, turn the box round,</span><span style=\"color: rgb(243,121,52);\"><br></span><span style=\"color: rgb(243,121,52);font-size: 18px;font-family: SassoonInfantRg-Regular;\">Lift the lid and listen for the sound! </span></li>\n<li>Point to your ear as you say ‘listen’.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>As you open the lid, make a sound with your voice that matches one of the objects.  Keep the sound going (with the lid in front of our mouth) until you shut the lid, to extend the magic!&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Can your child guess the sound? Can they make the sounds with you?&nbsp;</li>\n</ol>\n", "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": false, "selectedModalId": null, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": {"heading": "", "checkList": [{"key": "1CltitKIMcJoUNgBOLfZs", "checked": false, "listItem": ""}], "description": ""}, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 381647220, "text": null, "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 4, "btnType": "PRIMARY", "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "EDITOR", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{'headers':['Col1'],'rows':[{'col1':'row1'},{'col1':'row2'}, {'col1':'row3'}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": 360935656, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": "<h2>How to play:</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>Sit opposite your child, holding the box.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>The box becomes ‘magic’ when you turn it around in your hand, saying the rhyme: <br><span style=\"color: rgb(243,121,52);font-size: 18px;font-family: SassoonInfantRg-Regular;\">Turn, turn, turn the box round,</span><span style=\"color: rgb(243,121,52);\"><br></span>